  "method": "Counting Rust allocator plus size-only accelerator; actual model control flow, no GPU math or tensor data. Pending resources are retained through synchronization. Excludes Metal/Objective-C allocations, page rounding, driver overhead and process RSS. The new simulator skips direct host initialization callbacks; image host-fill time and CPU buffers are not comparable across versions. Images have synthetic pixels at 5344 by 3044. Times are simulator times, not inference throughput. Baseline image_after_text resets position before the image; the candidate retains text history, with the same capacity and working-memory budget.",
